ma-withdrawal | WHAT is established (the perplexity path is broken for gemma-4 on this stack, on both backends, at every context and flag combination tested). WHY is NOT established. The monotonic context dependence is consistent with attention or positional handling failing beyond the sliding window, but that is INFERENCE, not a measurement, and it is contradicted by llama-server staying coherent past 1,024 generated tokens. Recorded as an open instrument defect, not diagnosed. | ts=2026-08-23T18:42:17 CAVEAT gemma-decisive-arm | Because the perplexity path is broken above ~1k tokens of context while the generation path is not, the benchmark arm's prompts (GSM8K/HumanEval/MBPP, all short) and its 16,384-token cap are reported with the truncation counts and the scores themselves as the check: implausible scores would indicate the defect reaches the generation path too. | ts=2026-08-23T18:42:17
